{
  "name": "Daily AI news digest from Google News to Telegram",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "62890f29-c68f-4856-91f4-3acac35dac78",
      "name": "Every morning at 8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "0199f50f-5988-4556-89e6-3326c97b7a74",
              "name": "keywords",
              "value": "openai, nvidia",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "5b80e35f-38fb-45f2-a9bc-ef762c5b50de",
              "name": "region",
              "value": "US:en",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "8854218a-5bc6-4284-a5f5-1dec8a5b27cd",
              "name": "maxArticles",
              "value": 10,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "3494e00c-4130-420a-bfef-9744dd6db4b6",
              "name": "language",
              "value": "English",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "e2822551-95eb-4e72-a967-6a1ef6e61c4b",
              "name": "telegramChatId",
              "value": "YOUR_CHAT_ID",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "25268739-b676-4299-a3ae-ebd400c73e92",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/data_xplorer~google-news-scraper-fast/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ keywords: $json.keywords.split(\",\").map(k => k.trim()).filter(k => k), timeframe: \"1d\", region_language: $json.region, maxArticles: Number($json.maxArticles), decodeUrls: true, extractDescriptions: true, extractImages: false, extractFullText: true }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "17453f0b-97b0-4f7d-b378-bd806ea357cd",
      "name": "Run Google News (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Apify (Header Auth)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Builds one prompt with every article (title, source, URL and the start of the text).\nconst s = $('Settings').first().json;\nconst articles = $input.all().map((i) => i.json).filter((a) => a.title);\nif (!articles.length) return []; // nothing published: no digest, no message\nconst blocks = articles.map((a, i) => `[${i + 1}] ${a.title}\\nSource: ${a.source || '?'} | ${a.publishedAt || ''}\\nURL: ${a.url}\\n`\n  + `${(a.fullText || a.description || '').slice(0, 1500)}`);\nreturn [{ json: {\n  count: articles.length,\n  prompt: `You write a short daily news digest in ${s.language} for the topics: ${s.keywords}.\\n`\n    + `Group related articles, keep the 5 to 8 most important stories, one or two sentences each, `\n    + `and end each story with its source and URL. Plain text, no markdown tables, under 3,000 characters.\\n\\n`\n    + `Articles of the last 24 hours:\\n\\n${blocks.join('\\n\\n')}`,\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "89ad1354-39f0-4505-bef1-cc55f4eae704",
      "name": "Build the prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.prompt }}"
      },
      "id": "ea904ba4-2b8b-4fbe-901e-127966683820",
      "name": "Write the digest",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-5-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6da2e285-acbb-42f7-8528-de9e2d79eeaa",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        520
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Telegram messages are limited to 4,096 characters.\nconst s = $('Settings').first().json;\nconst body = String($json.text || '').trim();\nconst head = `🗞️ Daily news digest: ${s.keywords}\\n\\n`;\nreturn [{ json: { text: (head + body).slice(0, 4000) } }];"
      },
      "id": "60084ea2-940b-47c0-aae0-e622bc883496",
      "name": "Format the message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.telegramChatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "disable_web_page_preview": true
        }
      },
      "id": "ea4017cc-ae43-4994-8192-845654161909",
      "name": "Send to Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "0acd4232-b5c3-4c39-878a-c761c0b3a253",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily AI news digest\nEvery morning, gets the last 24 hours of Google News for your keywords with the full article text, asks an OpenAI model for a short digest and sends it to Telegram. No article, no message.\n\n### Requirements\n- An Apify account (free plan works) and its API token\n- A Telegram bot (create one with @BotFather) and your chat ID\n\n- An OpenAI API key (or any other chat model node)\n\n### Setup\n1. **Run ... (Apify)** node: create a *Header Auth* credential, name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN` (free account at apify.com, token in Settings > API & Integrations).\n2. **Send to Telegram**: add your bot credential.\n3. **Settings**: put your Telegram chat ID and your own values.\n4. *Test workflow*, then *Activate*.\n5. **OpenAI Chat Model**: add your OpenAI key, or swap in any other chat model node.\n\n### Limitations\n- Paywalled sites may only give their first paragraphs, so their stories are summarized from the description.\n- The message is cut at 4,000 characters (Telegram limit).",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "adb450e7-a2a8-43ac-9c4f-05afe9609208",
      "name": "Note -480",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
